  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Among the two statements</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is a contradiction and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a tautology</p>",
    "image": null
